{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53814","headline":"别後寄美人 · 白居易","name":"别後寄美人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫怪红巾遮面笑，春风吹绽牡丹花。\n（见前书卷下《妓女》）（〖1〗川口久雄校注云：「私注作『《别後寄美人》，白』。\n《佳句·美女》作『白《春词》』。\n《文集》、《全唐诗》均未见。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}